ID field.

88
00:05:29.195 --> 00:05:32.031
This is returned automatically.

89
00:05:32.031 --> 00:05:34.867
You can exclude it by indicating

90
00:05:34.867 --> 00:05:37.904
the number zero
as the value for the field.

91
00:05:38.538 --> 00:05:40.340
This is an exclusion.

92
00:05:40.340 --> 00:05:43.343
To include a field in a projection,

93
00:05:43.643 --> 00:05:46.713
you would mention the name of the field

94
00:05:47.714 --> 00:05:48.281
