134
00:08:16.729 --> 00:08:20.933
Meaning, if you're conducting an
inclusion, use the one pattern throughout.

135
00:08:21.367 --> 00:08:25.505
If you're conducting an exclusion, use
a zero pattern throughout.

136
00:08:25.905 --> 00:08:29.709
The only exception to this rule
is the underscore ID field.

137
00:08:30.510 --> 00:08:32.011
Let me show you an example.

138
